[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: The exporter document model becomes flat Perspective rows

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @repo

[MECHANISM]
UID: MECH-SDOC-PERSPECTIVE-ROW-ADAPTER
TITLE: The exporter document model becomes flat Perspective rows
DEPTH: interface-settled
AUTHORED_BY: llm
STATEMENT: >>>
The adapter emits one row per entry in each exported document NODES array. It copies every scalar node field unchanged, adds DOCUMENT_TITLE, RELATION_COUNT, RELATION_ROLES and RELATION_TARGETS facets, and retains the complete exported relation list as canonical JSON text in RELATIONS_JSON. It discards the repeated GRAMMAR payload and does not infer source paths or inspect sdoc files.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Perspective consumes row-oriented JSON with stable scalar columns, while StrictDoc relations are nested objects and the exporter repeats the grammar in every document.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: DEC-SDOC-PERSPECTIVE-EXPORT-BOUNDARY
  ROLE: Governed_By
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-SDOC-PERSPECTIVE-FRESH-DATA
  ROLE: Guarantees
